---
import DataPath from './DataPath.astro';
import { links } from '../lib/links';
---
<section class="section" id="how-it-works">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="sec-head">
      <p class="label">How it fits together</p>
      <div>
        <h2>From a question to Db2 for i and back.</h2>
        <p class="lead">The server sits between your AI assistant and the IBM i. Every request passes the same checks, whichever client or driver you use.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <DataPath class="wide-only" nodes={[{ at: '0%' }, { at: '19.5%' }, { at: '39%', on: true }, { at: '66.5%' }, { at: '85%' }]} />
    <ol class="nodes">
      <li>
        <span class="label">Client</span>
        <h3>AI assistant</h3>
        <p>Claude, Cursor, Claude Code, or any client that speaks the <a href={links.mcp}>Model Context Protocol</a>.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="label">Server</span>
        <h3>mcp-server-db2i</h3>
        <p>stdio on your machine, or HTTP with OAuth for a team.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="policy">
        <span class="label">Policy</span>
        <h3>Checks on every call</h3>
        <ul>
          <li>Read-only SQL validation <span>ON</span></li>
          <li>Library allowlist <span>ON</span></li>
          <li>Column masking <span>OPT</span></li>
          <li>Rate limits and audit log <span>OPT</span></li>
        </ul>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="label">Driver</span>
        <h3>ODBC, JT400 or Mapepire</h3>
        <p>Host server ports, or SSH only.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="label">System</span>
        <h3>Db2 for i</h3>
        <p>Runs with the user's own authority. Exit programs still apply.</p>
      </li>
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .wide-only { display: none; }
  @media (min-width: 1000px) { .wide-only { display: block; } }
  .nodes { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 18px 0 0; display: grid; gap: 28px; }
  @media (min-width: 1000px) { .nodes { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1.3fr 1fr 1fr; gap: 32px; margin-top: 22px; } }
  @media (max-width: 999px) { .nodes > li { border-top: 1px solid var(--line); padding-top: 16px; } .nodes > li:first-child { border-top: 1px solid var(--line-strong); } }
  .nodes > li { display: grid; gap: 6px; align-content: start; }
  .nodes h3 { margin: 0; font-size: 1.15rem; }
  .nodes p { margin: 0; font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--muted); }
  .policy h3 { color: var(--accent); }
  .policy ul { list-style: none; margin: 6px 0 0; padding: 0; font: 12.5px/1.4 var(--font-mono); }
  .policy ul li { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 8px; padding: 6px 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .policy ul span { color: var(--accent); }
</style>
